	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratiam a domino.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Certo ad vos hoc nuncio<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Unbekannt.</note> nacto, quomodo res mea se habeat, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>indicare vel verbo placuit.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Quid callidus suis machinacionibus ac cuni<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>culis insidiator queat, hodie revera expertus sum.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Quando enim per om<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>nia catechizmo <persName ref="p467">Buceri</persName> nomen dare <persName ref="p8412">Megander</persName> noluit, in pedes <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>se vel <placeName ref="l587">Tigurum</placeName> versus dare<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Zur Redensart vgl. <persName ref="p19874">Plautus</persName>, Captivi 121.</note> cogitur.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Senatus enim ac populi con<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>sulto<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">d. h. durch Beschluß des Kleinen und Großen Rates. -Zur Ratssitzung vom 24. Dezember s. <hi>Straßer</hi> 148f.</note> ob subscripcionis recusacionem missus factus est, beneficii tamen, <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>ut ita dicam, stipendio ad quadragesimam usque concesso.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Nihil potuit <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>amplius Christus, id quod nemo pius plurimum non dolet, deflet ac <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>deplorat.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Verendum certe, ne horum hominum consiliis ac conatibus maius <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>aliquod malum statuatur.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Plerique enim adfectantes principum <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>munera et id genus alia.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Quando non aliud quicquam, quantum me <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>attinet, expectandum esse<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a">esse <hi>vom Schreiber korrigiert aus</hi> est.</note> nec vobis eciam hac in re tentandum vi<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>deo<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b">video <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note> excepto consilio <persName ref="p2810">Erasmo</persName> dando<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Vgl. unten Z. 17-23.</note>, reditum ad domum maturabo.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Solum <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>hoc vos<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c"><hi>vor</hi> vos <hi>gestrichenes</hi> vo.</note> iterum oro rogoque, ut rebus meis consulatis<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5"><persName ref="p8412">Megander</persName> hatte bereits mehrfach gebeten, ihm eine passende Behausung zu verschaffen; s. zuletzt oben <ref target="file11125">Nr. 1082</ref>, 23.</note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l41">Bernę</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>24. decembris anno 37.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/><persName ref="p8412">Megand.</persName> totus vester.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/><persName ref="p2810">Erasmus</persName>, de quo supra, subscripcionem pollicetur, sed sub condicione, <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>quo non parum ecclesia nostra suspensa et dubia facta est.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Si qui <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>mecum recusasset dedicionem, non dubito, ecclesia nostra aliquid conata <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>esset aut conaretur adhuc hodie ad infringendum hoc malum.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/>Consulite igitur homini, quod sanctum et syncerum est, idque primo <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>quoque die.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Unicum hoc certe<pb type="edition" next="342"/> medium est, quo malum hoc a nobis <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>auferetur, si vestro consilio recusaturus est subscripcionem.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Ecclesię <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName> verbi mi<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>nistris <persName ref="p495">Bullingero</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>et <persName ref="p1753">Leoni</persName> vigilantissimis, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>in domino fratribus charissimis.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z5"/><placeName ref="l587">Zurich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
